        {"zh": "我的爪子犁开一道月尘沟。", "en": "My claws plow a furrow in the dust."},
        {"zh": "我在等你转身的那一瞬。", "en": "I wait for the instant you turn."},
        {"zh": "我的低吟越来越短促。", "en": "My low growl grows shorter and shorter."},
        {"zh": "月亮正升到我的背后。", "en": "The moon climbs right behind me."},
        {"zh": "我肩胛绷紧，随时前扑。", "en": "My shoulders bunch, ready to spring."},
        {"zh": "我在数你的脚步声。", "en": "I am counting your footsteps."}
      ]
    },
